# E-Cropolis

E-Cropolis, our game-level evolution to SimCity and Micropolis, proposes a careful extension: retain the city and its economic machinery, but allow it progressively to recover living capabilities. Food production, soil, water, seed, biodiversity, energy, organic material cycles and ecological memory become parts of the simulated city. A tower need not be either a building or habitat: it might simultaneously house people, collect rain, generate electricity, support vines and pollinators, compost residues and produce food.
